---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-zinc-100 px-6 py-16 text-zinc-900">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl bg-white px-6 py-10 shadow-sm sm:px-10">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-700 hover:text-red-800">&larr; Back to home</a>
      <h1 class="mt-8 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-500">Last updated: August 26, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 leading-7 text-zinc-700">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">1. What cookies are</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help websites remember information and understand how visitors use them.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">2. How we use cookies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">This website may use strictly necessary cookies to provide core functionality, protect the website, and remember your privacy choices. These cookies cannot be disabled through this website.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">If analytics, advertising, or other non-essential services are enabled, they will only be used in accordance with applicable consent requirements.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">3. Managing cookies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. Blocking some cookies may affect how parts of the website work.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">4. Contact us</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">For questions about our use of cookies, contact us at <a class="text-red-700 underline" href="mailto:REPLACE_WITH_PRIVACY_EMAIL">REPLACE_WITH_PRIVACY_EMAIL</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">5. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We may update this Cookie Policy when our services or legal obligations change. The latest version will always be available on this page.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
